{"title":"Alpha Werewolf","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 35 Werewolf that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 14 times (3.1% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: frenzyCadenceMult: .7</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/lycan-claw\">Lycan Claw</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=34\">Lv 34 <span>340</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=35\">Lv 35 <span>353</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=36\">Lv 36 <span>394</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=37\">Lv 37 <span>409</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=44\">Lv 44 <span>46</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>162</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=46\">Lv 46 <span>159</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=47\">Lv 47 <span>135</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). I